    concentration; +7.5 % decode at FRAC 80 and +16.4 % at FRAC 60 at identical pinned bytes,
    for -13/-15 % prefill.
  * Diagnostics: moe_cache_report now reports the RUN (it used to print an emptied cache in
    every mode -- the artefact that once made "the pool never activated" look like a bug), a
    forced MOE_HOST_POOL_DIO logs its mode, bounce_acquire owns the pinned bounce ring (the
    ring total is finally true: 2209-3108 MiB on the 122B, uncapped on purpose -- a cap costs
