Held back deliberately: MOE_HOST_POOL_FRAC=100 as the default.  It is +16 % decode over 80 on
one GPU, but the RAM ceiling does not yet reserve the model's own pageable footprint, and on a
multi-device split 100 % measured 9 % SLOWER than 95 % (4 GiB more pinned, 42 GiB more disk per
run), over-committed a 91 GiB box once, and lost to 80 % on the 1-GPU srv cell.  Default stays 80.

